  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "50: the hypocrites' saying is framed («متبجحين…»). 52:8-22 is not glossed: both tafsirs speak of killing them by the believers' hands, and Al-Muyassar's closing «ما الله فاعل…» reads as a negation when cut. No motif on the Prophet ﷺ (50 is addressed to him). Geometric for «كتب الله لنا», light for «فليتوكل المؤمنون», two paths for «إحدى الحسنيين», an hourglass for «فتربصوا»."
